        // Note: In the test environment msg.sender for calls to c will be this contract. The actual owner of c at deployment was msg.sender then.
        // We assert property about behavior: if this contract is owner (initialOwner == address(this)), then owner-only calls must succeed (not revert)
        // otherwise they must not increase how much Ether left c (i.e., balance cannot decrease due to a non-owner call).

        bool amOwner = (initialOwner == address(this));

